{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:56:37+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Pact", "steam_appid": 2498740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate enemy positions and make use of clever combos in this tactical turn-based strategy game with a focus on creativity rather than number crunching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Carnage Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if Into the Breach had a full campaign?</i> That question sparked the creation of <strong>Dark Pact</strong>, a game designed to push your tactical skills to the limit while delivering an emotional, gripping story. Inspired by <strong>Fire Emblem, Advance Wars, and Into the Breach</strong>, Dark Pact aims to stand alongside these legendary titles. Does it succeed? Play the demo and find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/5f711010ab35faef9b230656fdcc8ce8.poster.avif?t=1784889168\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/5f711010ab35faef9b230656fdcc8ce8.webm?t=1784889168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Devastating Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory isn’t just about dealing damage—it’s about control. Abilities in Dark Pact don’t just hit hard; they <strong>push, pull, taunt, and disrupt</strong>, keeping the battlefield in constant flux. Creativity is key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth Splitter</strong> – Deal damage in a line and push adjacent units</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/cd78b7c4495165bbe4b2644aaaa6dbc7.poster.avif?t=1784889168\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/cd78b7c4495165bbe4b2644aaaa6dbc7.webm?t=1784889168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast Off</strong> – Launch the target and push back the caster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/c320cadfdf0472832309969f2c36218f.poster.avif?t=1784889168\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/c320cadfdf0472832309969f2c36218f.webm?t=1784889168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boomerang</strong> – Strike multiple targets in a single throw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/1c595893bd4c0f34901433a7e30d3aac.poster.avif?t=1784889168\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/1c595893bd4c0f34901433a7e30d3aac.webm?t=1784889168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Two Enemies Are Alike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face an ever-changing roster of foes, each requiring a unique approach. Battle <strong>cowardly goblins</strong> that scatter under pressure, <strong>raging minotaurs</strong> that charge headfirst into danger, and <strong>flaming skeletons</strong> that explode on impact. Every encounter is a fresh tactical puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chapter ends with a <strong>high-stakes boss fight</strong>, testing everything you’ve learned. Precision, strategy, and mastery of the battlefield are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/333b7f46858e5ea0875b31901f8170ee.poster.avif?t=1784889168\" width=600 height=790 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2498740/extras/333b7f46858e5ea0875b31901f8170ee.webm?t=1784889168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple to Learn, Deep in Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <strong>Dark Pact</strong> revolves around <strong>displacement and enemy manipulation</strong>. Every attack is telegraphed, giving you the chance to <strong>intervene at the perfect moment</strong>—redirecting enemies into each other’s attacks, baiting them into deadly hazards, or launching an ogre straight into a pit of lava. The most effective strategies aren’t always obvious, but they’re always satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your tactics? Try the demo and see if you can master <strong>Dark Pact</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate enemy positions and make use of clever combos in this tactical turn-based strategy game with a focus on creativity rather than number crunching.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tac